 0001           ; /**************************************************************************
 0001           ; DOES:    This function is called if a fatal error occurred. 
 0001           ;          Error codes of mcohwxxx.c are in the range of 0x8000 to 0x87FF.
 0001           ;          Error codes of mco.c are in the range of 0x8800 to 0x8FFF. 
 0001           ;          All other error codes may be used by the application.
 0001           ; RETURNS: nothing
